#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:5
msgid "Draft"
msgstr "Draft"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:7
msgid ""
"**Draft** is a dimensioned technical drawing of a part or an assembly -- the"
" drawing somebody is handed to make the thing, with its views laid out, its "
"dimensions and its title block."
msgstr ""
"**Draft** 是零件或装配体的一张带尺寸的技术图纸 -- 也就是交到某人手上去把东西做出来的那张图，上面安排好了各个视图、各项尺寸和标题栏。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:11
msgid ""
"PartCAD does not draw it. A **drawing package** does, the way an export "
"implementation writes a file (see :doc:`/plugins/output`), and the tab "
"names the one it used. Three are offered: draftwright, which dimensions "
"what it draws; SolidCraft, which lays out the standard views on an ISO "
"sheet with its title block and places no dimensions; and CADCraft, which "
"dimensions the overall sizes and the holes of the views PartCAD projects,"
" on an ISO sheet with a title block."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD 不画它。画它的是一个 **制图包**，方式与导出实现写出一个文件相同（参见 :doc:`/plugins/output` "
"），而该标签页会指出它用的是哪一个。提供了三个：draftwright，会给所画的内容标注尺寸；SolidCraft，会把标准视图连同标题栏排布在一张"
" ISO 图纸上，但不标注尺寸；以及 CADCraft，会给 PartCAD 投影出的视图标注总体尺寸和孔径，排布在带标题栏的 ISO 图纸上。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:19
msgid "In the UI"
msgstr "在界面中"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Drawn by** names the drawing package: "
"``//pub/feature/render/draftwright`` unless you choose "
"``//pub/feature/cad/solidcraft`` or ``//pub/feature/cad/cadcraft``, or "
"type another, exactly as ``pc render -e`` names one. The formats offered "
"are whatever that package declares -- PDF, SVG and DXF for draftwright, "
"and PNG as well for SolidCraft; for CADCraft, PDF, SVG and PNG are the "
"sheet, and its DWG and DXF a single view -- and **Save…** writes the "
"file."
msgstr ""
"**Drawn by** 指出所用的制图包：除非你选择 ``//pub/feature/cad/solidcraft`` 或 "
"``//pub/feature/cad/cadcraft`` ，或手工输入另一个，否则就是 "
"``//pub/feature/render/draftwright`` ，与 ``pc render -e`` "
"指名一个制图包的方式完全相同。所提供的格式就是那个包所声明的那些 -- 对 draftwright 而言是 PDF、SVG 和 "
"DXF，SolidCraft 还多一个 PNG；对 CADCraft 而言，PDF、SVG 和 PNG 是整张图纸，DWG 和 DXF "
"则是单个视图 -- 而 **Save…** 会把文件写出来。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:29
msgid ""
"A picture is shown on the tab and can be zoomed, dragged and put back with a"
" double-click. A PDF or a DXF cannot be drawn there; it is saved and opened "
"in another program instead."
msgstr "标签页上会显示一张图片，可以缩放、拖动，并双击复位。PDF 或 DXF 无法在那里绘制；它们会被保存下来，再用别的程序打开。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:33
msgid ""
"The Design group's Draft tab: a dimensioned drawing, with \"Drawn by\" above"
" it"
msgstr "Design 组的 Draft 标签页：一张带尺寸的图纸，上方是“Drawn by”"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:38
msgid ""
"The first drawing takes a few minutes, while PartCAD installs the drawing "
"package into the sandbox it runs in; afterwards it is as quick as any other "
"render, and cached under everything it depends on. A drawing package lays "
"its views out itself, so the :ref:`view panel's <dt-design-3d>` axis buttons"
" and viewpoint are disabled here and say why -- a section is not, and the "
"drawing is made of the cut object."
msgstr ""
"第一张图会花几分钟，因为 PartCAD "
"要先把那个制图包安装到它所运行的那个沙箱里；之后它就和其他任何渲染一样快，并且会按它所依赖的一切内容被缓存。制图包自己安排它的各个视图，所以 "
":ref:`视图面板 <dt-design-3d>` 的那些轴按钮和视角在这里是禁用的，并会说明原因 -- "
"而剖切不禁用，图纸就是用剖切之后的对象画出来的。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:46
msgid "On the command line"
msgstr "在命令行中"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:57
msgid "Agent skills"
msgstr "智能体技能"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:59
msgid "``/pc:render``"
msgstr "``/pc:render``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/design_draft.rst:60
msgid "Asks for a drawing like any other rendered file."
msgstr "像索取其他任何渲染文件那样去索取一张图纸。"
